  "aiContextParagraph": "The investigation into former National Police Chief Listyo Sigit Prabowo and his associates continues to develop following allegations of treason and illegal surveillance. Criminal investigation units within the National Police (Bareskrim) have uncovered evidence suggesting the existence of a specialized team tasked with securing illicit funds to support these activities. Officials have indicated that the group allegedly aimed to incite civil unrest during a period of leadership transition within the police force. Furthermore, evidence has surfaced regarding the use of multiple cyber accounts to coordinate attacks against the government. Public scrutiny of the case has intensified, with advocacy groups calling for transparency regarding the intercepted data. The Attorney General’s Office has now formally assigned a team of 32 researchers to manage the ongoing case files, as broader calls for a comprehensive investigation into the scope of the alleged conspiracy grow.",
